category: Libs
requires: libcld0 pkg-config
sdesc: "C++ library and Python bindings for detecting language from UTF8 text, extracted from the Chromium browser (development)"
ldesc: "This is a straight port from the CLD (Compact Language Detector) library
embedded in Google's Chromium browser. The library detects the language from
provided UTF8 text (plain text or HTML). It's implemented in C++, with very
basic Python bindings."
external-source: compact-language-detector

